OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors urged to avoid bonfire
OL,4,Aevent in Lewes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncils, emergency services, and
OL,7,Ftransport providers in East Sussex have
OL,8,Furged visitors to avoid travelling to
OL,9,FLewes' bonfire celebrations as higher
OL,10,Flevels of attendance than normal are
OL,11,Fexpected this year.
OL,13,FTens of thousands of people attend the
OL,14,FLewes Bonfire procession in the town
OL,15,Fevery November, and because this year's
OL,16,Fevent falls on a Thursday, there is an
OL,17,Fexpectation that the crowds will be
OL,18,Fbigger.
OL,20,FThe parade sees effigies paraded
OL,21,Fthrough the town, climaxing in a huge
OL,22,Fbonfire and firework display.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
