OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Sussex County Council, Lewes
OL,7,FDistrict Council, East Sussex Fire and
OL,8,FRescue Service, South East Coast
OL,9,FAmbulance Service and Sussex Police are
OL,10,Famong the bodies to issue the warning.
